  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joining Perspectives: Mtarajiwa Rais</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study will establish collaboration between Venstres Ungdom (Denmark) and Liberty Sparks (Kenya) to design &quot;Mtarajiwa Rais,&quot; a pilot project promoting issue-based politics among Kenyan youth before the 2027 elections. The study will assess challenges in youth political engagement, examine urban-rural and gender disparities, and develop a partnership framework. Furthermore to write the partnership agreement contract. The proposed project will engage 750+ university students (18-25) through university outreach, policy workshops, a competitive hackathon, and a Youth Policy Network. It aims to shift from ethnicity-based to issue-based politics, enhance policy understanding, develop young leaders, and ensure 40% female participation.</narrative>
  </description>
